 {"type":"root","forms":["spect","spic","spec"],"meaning":"看","origin":"拉丁语 specere「看」","note":"","examples":[{"w":"inspect","parts":"in(向内) + spect(看)","m":"检查"},{"w":"perspective","parts":"per(贯穿) + spect(看) + ive(…的)","m":"观点"},{"w":"speculate","parts":"spec(看) + ul + ate(动词)","m":"推测；投机"}]},
